<div class="page-width page-margin">
  <div class="rte">
    <h1>Shipping Policy</h1>

    <p>At LAMBATY, we aim to make every delivery clear, reliable, and easy to track. Below you’ll find important information about order processing, shipping, delivery, and what to do if an issue occurs.</p>

    <h2>Free Shipping Within Saudi Arabia</h2>
    <p>We offer free shipping on all LAMBATY orders delivered within Saudi Arabia. There is no additional standard shipping fee for domestic orders.</p>

    <h2>Order Processing</h2>
    <p>Orders are typically processed within 1 business day before being handed to the delivery carrier.</p>
    <p>Orders placed late on Thursday, on Friday, or during public holidays may require an additional business day for processing or dispatch.</p>
    <p>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive tracking information so you can follow the progress of your delivery.</p>

    <h2>Estimated Delivery</h2>
    <p>Once dispatched, orders within Saudi Arabia are typically delivered within 1-3 business days.</p>
    <p>Delivery times are estimates and may vary depending on the destination, courier operations, public holidays, remote delivery locations, weather conditions, or other circumstances outside our reasonable control.</p>

    <h2>Order Tracking</h2>
    <p>Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive a tracking number and tracking instructions using the contact information provided during checkout.</p>
    <p>Please allow some time for tracking updates to appear after the shipment has been handed to the delivery carrier.</p>

    <h2>Delivery Information</h2>
    <p>Customers are responsible for providing complete and accurate delivery information when placing an order, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Full name</li>
      <li>Mobile number</li>
      <li>Delivery address</li>
      <li>City</li>
      <li>Any additional information required for successful delivery</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Incorrect or incomplete information may result in delays or failed delivery attempts.</p>
    <p>If you notice an error in your delivery information after placing an order, please contact us as soon as possible at <a href="mailto:info@lambaty.sa">info@lambaty.sa</a>.</p>
    <p>We cannot guarantee that delivery details can be changed once an order has already been dispatched.</p>

    <h2>Delivery Delays</h2>
    <p>While we work with our delivery partners to ensure orders arrive as quickly as possible, delays may occasionally occur due to courier operations, public holidays, weather conditions, remote delivery locations, or other circumstances outside our reasonable control.</p>
    <p>If your order appears significantly delayed, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@lambaty.sa">info@lambaty.sa</a> and we will assist where possible.</p>

    <h2>Damaged Packages or Product Issues</h2>
    <p>Please inspect your order as soon as possible after delivery.</p>
    <p>If your package arrives with visible physical damage, or if you discover a genuine functional issue with the lamp, please contact us within 7 days of delivery so our team can review the issue as quickly as possible.</p>
    <p>When contacting us, please include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your order number</li>
      <li>A clear description of the issue</li>
      <li>Clear photos or videos showing the damage or problem</li>
      <li>Photos of the packaging where relevant</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Please keep the original product packaging and included accessories while the issue is being reviewed.</p>
    <p>Eligible requests will be assessed in accordance with our <a href="/pages/returns-refund-policy">Returns / Refund Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>International Shipping</h2>
    <p>LAMBATY currently ships within Saudi Arabia.</p>
    <p>International shipping may be introduced in the future. When available, shipping fees and estimated delivery times will vary by destination and will be shown during checkout.</p>

    <h2>Need Help?</h2>
    <p>For questions about your order or delivery, contact us at: <a href="mailto:info@lambaty.sa">info@lambaty.sa</a></p>
    <p>We aim to respond within 1-2 business days.</p>
  </div>
</div>

